                <head>Agreements between the United States and Ireland</head>
                <p rendition="#center">ECONOMIC COOPERATION AGREEMENT BETWEEN THE UNITED STATES AND
                    IRELAND AMENDING THE AGREEMENT OF JUNE 28, 1948</p>
                <p>[For text of Agreement effected by exchange of notes signed at Washington
                    February 17 and 18, 1950, which entered into force February 18, 1950, see <hi
                        rendition="#italic">United States Treaties and Other International
                        Agreements</hi>, volume 1, page 157.]</p>
                <p rendition="#center">FRIENDSHIP, COMMERCE, AND NAVIGATION TREATY BETWEEN THE
                    UNITED STATES AND IRELAND</p>
                <p>[For text of Treaty and Protocol signed at Dublin January 21, 1950, which entered
                    into force September 14, 1950, when ratifications were exchanged at Dublin, and
                    which was proclaimed by the President of the United States December 15, 1950,
                    see 1 UST 785.]</p>
            </div>
